<title>USA: Mellon Bank in deal with HNC.</title>
<headline>Mellon Bank in deal with HNC.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mellon Bank said it signed an agreement with HNC Software Inc to use HNC's ProfitMax Bankruptcy, a cardholder bankruptcy prediction system that provides transaction-based account monitoring for indications of potential bankruptcy.</p>
<p>ProfitMax Bankruptcy uses neural networks and HNC's cardholder behavior profiling technology to analyze each cardholder account and predict its likelihood of going bankrupt.</p>
